STATEMENT: >>>
A fourth extensionless bash script would go unparsed silently:
SOURCE_EXTRACTORS names the three extensionless scripts by path; nothing
notices a new tracked extensionless file with a bash shebang. A check that
greps tracked extensionless files for #! bash and fails on one not in the
manifest would close it. Accepted gap per the operator's "glob not covered
not in scope"; filed so it is visible.
<<<
